01:02:26.480 --> 01:02:28.480
On this trajectory, where do you see this going?

01:02:28.480 --> 01:02:32.890
I honestly don't see it getting any better.

01:02:32.890 --> 01:02:37.890
And part of the reason is that this is not at all a partisan issue.

01:02:37.890 --> 01:02:41.890
Democrats and Republicans' ideas about Israel

01:02:41.890 --> 01:02:44.890
are almost identical, at least within the mainstream.

01:02:44.890 --> 01:02:46.890
Of course, there are going to be these radicals

01:02:46.890 --> 01:02:48.890
on the far left and on the far right

01:02:48.890 --> 01:02:50.890
that are going to have a different position.

01:02:50.890 --> 01:02:53.890
But there's no pressure from the United States

01:02:53.890 --> 01:02:56.890
for the Israelis to change their position.

01:02:56.890 --> 01:03:03.890
And there are no bold desires or propositions

01:03:03.890 --> 01:03:07.890
for overarching peace agreements.

01:03:07.890 --> 01:03:11.890
We're not seeing calls for Oslo, another Oslo round.

01:03:11.890 --> 01:03:16.890
We're not seeing calls for a grand deal

01:03:16.890 --> 01:03:18.890
to make all of these issues go away.

01:03:18.890 --> 01:03:21.890
And in fact, I think that the Saudis

01:03:21.890 --> 01:03:24.890
would be interested in participating in something like that.

01:03:24.890 --> 01:03:27.890
Undoubtedly, the Qataris would be interested in participating.

01:03:27.890 --> 01:03:31.890
The Palestinians would probably beg to participate in something.

01:03:31.890 --> 01:03:34.890
But the Israelis know that nobody's going to force them.

01:03:34.890 --> 01:03:37.890
And so there's no incentive for them to go to the negotiating table.

01:03:37.890 --> 01:03:38.890
So what happens in Gaza?

01:03:38.890 --> 01:03:40.890
And then, of course, they're just going to expand more in the Golan.

01:03:40.890 --> 01:03:42.890
They're going to expand to the West Bank.

01:03:42.890 --> 01:03:44.890
There is a greater Israel project.

01:03:44.890 --> 01:03:45.890
That's not a conspiracy theory.

01:03:45.890 --> 01:03:48.890
They wear it on their army IDF uniforms.

01:03:48.890 --> 01:03:51.890
Hell, they want, like, to make Israel 10 times bigger.

01:03:51.890 --> 01:03:52.890
That's insane.

01:03:52.890 --> 01:03:53.890
Yeah.

01:03:53.890 --> 01:03:56.890
In fact, they bombed Syria again today.

01:03:56.890 --> 01:03:59.890
And the Syrians, you know, the Syrian government

01:03:59.890 --> 01:04:02.890
is just this little radical statelet

01:04:02.890 --> 01:04:04.890
that's trying to convince everybody

01:04:04.890 --> 01:04:06.890
that they've left their radicalism behind them.

01:04:06.890 --> 01:04:08.890
And I hope to God that they have.

01:04:08.890 --> 01:04:10.890
But the Israelis are free just to come and go

01:04:10.890 --> 01:04:12.890
and bomb anybody they want.

01:04:12.890 --> 01:04:13.890
And they do it.

01:04:13.890 --> 01:04:15.890
They do it all the time.

01:04:15.890 --> 01:04:17.890
So what do I expect in Gaza?

01:04:17.890 --> 01:04:19.890
I expect more of the same.

01:04:19.890 --> 01:04:22.890
I think that the plan is to turn the whole place to rubble.

01:04:22.890 --> 01:04:24.890
And it's to force Gazans out.

01:04:24.890 --> 01:04:27.890
You mentioned a few minutes ago

01:04:27.890 --> 01:04:30.890
that the Israelis had been encouraging Palestinians

01:04:30.890 --> 01:04:33.890
to move to the United States or move to Egypt

01:04:33.890 --> 01:04:34.890
or move to Jordan.

01:04:34.890 --> 01:04:36.890
And when that wasn't forthcoming,

01:04:36.890 --> 01:04:38.890
they came up with this cockamamie plan

01:04:38.890 --> 01:04:40.890
to take all the Gaza Palestinians

