01:04:46.890 --> 01:04:48.890
Then they came up with this stupid idea

01:04:48.890 --> 01:04:51.890
to send them all to an island off the coast of Indonesia.

01:04:51.890 --> 01:04:53.890
And the Indonesians said, well, we don't know anything about this.

01:04:53.890 --> 01:04:56.890
We know we're not giving up an island to become Palestine.

01:04:56.890 --> 01:05:00.890
The truth is, all of those are forms of genocide.

01:05:00.890 --> 01:05:03.890
Forced removal of a temple is a form of genocide.

01:05:03.890 --> 01:05:05.890
And we have the multi-thousand-year-old,

01:05:05.890 --> 01:05:07.890
three-thousand-year-old Moses and the Jews

01:05:07.890 --> 01:05:08.890
being kicked out of Egypt

01:05:08.890 --> 01:05:10.890
and then the Jews and the dysporos and Hitler.

01:05:10.890 --> 01:05:13.890
And they're literally doing what was done to them now.

01:05:13.890 --> 01:05:14.890
Exactly.

01:05:14.890 --> 01:05:15.890
Exactly.

01:05:15.890 --> 01:05:16.890
It wasn't right then.

01:05:16.890 --> 01:05:18.890
And it's not right now.

01:05:18.890 --> 01:05:19.890
Wow.

01:05:19.890 --> 01:05:20.890
And then you go, oh, there's all sorts of things

01:05:20.890 --> 01:05:22.890
that are Palestinian.

01:05:22.890 --> 01:05:24.890
None of them live there.

01:05:24.890 --> 01:05:25.890
I mean, it's just...

01:05:25.890 --> 01:05:26.890
Oh, I hate that argument so much.

01:05:26.890 --> 01:05:27.890
Don't you love Ben Shapiro?

01:05:27.890 --> 01:05:29.890
You mentioned it earlier, but you didn't say his name.

01:05:29.890 --> 01:05:32.890
He and others are like, there was only one Israeli spy,

01:05:32.890 --> 01:05:33.890
Jonathan Pollard.

01:05:33.890 --> 01:05:37.890
The former prime minister told me we don't spy on the US.

01:05:37.890 --> 01:05:40.890
But when Ted Cruz got asked about it a few weeks ago

01:05:40.890 --> 01:05:43.890
by Tucker, he said, well, of course they spy on us.

01:05:43.890 --> 01:05:44.890
They're our friends.

01:05:44.890 --> 01:05:45.890
Of course they do.

01:05:45.890 --> 01:05:46.890
Yeah.

01:05:46.890 --> 01:05:47.890
Of course they do.

01:05:47.890 --> 01:05:48.890
Of course they do.

01:05:48.890 --> 01:05:49.890
They always have.

01:05:49.890 --> 01:05:51.890
It's as simple as that.

01:05:51.890 --> 01:05:53.890
And if you talk to anybody who has served

01:05:53.890 --> 01:05:55.890
at the American embassy in Israel,

01:05:55.890 --> 01:05:57.890
whether when it was going to be for now...

01:05:57.890 --> 01:05:58.890
I saw you on a podcast.

01:05:58.890 --> 01:05:59.890
I forget which one.

01:05:59.890 --> 01:06:00.890
Tell that story.

01:06:00.890 --> 01:06:03.890
Describe out of all the intelligence agencies

01:06:03.890 --> 01:06:05.890
you've dealt with, I imagine it's dozens.

01:06:05.890 --> 01:06:07.890
Tell us how many, you know, directly...

01:06:07.890 --> 01:06:09.890
You've been all the world.

01:06:09.890 --> 01:06:12.890
Who is the most aggressive and the most deceptive?

01:06:12.890 --> 01:06:13.890
Yeah.

01:06:13.890 --> 01:06:15.890
By far the Mossad.

01:06:15.890 --> 01:06:17.890
There's just, hands down, there's just no comparison.

01:06:17.890 --> 01:06:21.890
I told the story on a podcast where two friends of mine

01:06:21.890 --> 01:06:25.890
with whom I worked at the CIA were transferred to Israel

01:06:25.890 --> 01:06:27.890
and they were both known to the Israeli services.

01:06:27.890 --> 01:06:28.890
They were declared.

01:06:28.890 --> 01:06:30.890
What's called declared to the Israeli services.

01:06:30.890 --> 01:06:32.890
So when they arrive in Israel,

01:06:32.890 --> 01:06:35.890
the station chief takes them to the Mossad

01:06:35.890 --> 01:06:37.890
and says, you know my two people here.

01:06:37.890 --> 01:06:39.890
They're going to be here for two years.

01:06:39.890 --> 01:06:42.890
They're not going to be working against Israel, of course.

01:06:42.890 --> 01:06:45.890
The wife is going to work on Palestinian issues

01:06:45.890 --> 01:06:49.890
at the embassy and the husband is going to take Arabic classes

01:06:49.890 --> 01:06:50.890
at the university.

01:06:50.890 --> 01:06:51.890
Everybody's happy.

01:06:51.890 --> 01:06:54.890
But then the ambassador has a welcome party for them

01:06:54.890 --> 01:06:56.890
and when they get back home from the welcome party,

01:06:56.890 --> 01:06:58.890
somebody had rearranged all the furniture

01:06:58.890 --> 01:07:01.890
in their living room just as a signal that,

01:07:01.890 --> 01:07:04.890
hey, we can mess with you anytime we want.

01:07:04.890 --> 01:07:08.890
And of course they reported it.

01:07:08.890 --> 01:07:11.890
Several months later, the ambassador has a Christmas party.

01:07:11.890 --> 01:07:13.890
They go to the Christmas party and they come back

01:07:13.890 --> 01:07:17.890
and people had defecated in all of the toilets in their house

01:07:17.890 --> 01:07:19.890
and left it unflushed.

01:07:19.890 --> 01:07:21.890
Now, why would you do that?

01:07:21.890 --> 01:07:23.890
Just to intimidate, just to anger

01:07:23.890 --> 01:07:25.890
and just to show disrespect.

01:07:25.890 --> 01:07:28.890
Finally, another year and a half passes.

01:07:28.890 --> 01:07:29.890
It's time for them to leave.

01:07:29.890 --> 01:07:32.890
The ambassador has a going away party for them.

01:07:32.890 --> 01:07:33.890
They go to the party.

01:07:33.890 --> 01:07:35.890
They drive back to Jerusalem.

01:07:35.890 --> 01:07:37.890
People had gone into the house.

01:07:37.890 --> 01:07:40.890
The dog was whimpering under the dining room table.

01:07:40.890 --> 01:07:43.890
They had cut the dog's tail off

01:07:43.890 --> 01:07:47.890
and they wrapped it in gauze and in medical tape.

01:07:47.890 --> 01:07:49.890
Now, why would you do something like that?

01:07:49.890 --> 01:07:55.890
What do you hope to accomplish just by treating an ally that way?

01:07:55.890 --> 01:07:58.890
And of course, the CIA has to go to the Israelis

01:07:58.890 --> 01:08:01.890
and say, stop harassing our people.

01:08:01.890 --> 01:08:03.890
And the Israelis say, okay, okay.

01:08:03.890 --> 01:08:05.890
And then they're good for a year or two.

01:08:05.890 --> 01:08:07.890
And then they just start doing it again.

01:08:07.890 --> 01:08:09.890
But that's the nature of our relationship.

01:08:09.890 --> 01:08:11.890
That is not how you make friends and influence people.

01:08:11.890 --> 01:08:12.890
No.

01:08:12.890 --> 01:08:13.890
I mean, take Sibachanik.

01:08:13.890 --> 01:08:15.890
I know he worked in Intelligence Bunch of Places,

01:08:15.890 --> 01:08:17.890
co-authored books with Tom Clancy.

01:08:17.890 --> 01:08:19.890
But he's Jewish, by the way.

01:08:19.890 --> 01:08:20.890
He said no.

01:08:20.890 --> 01:08:22.890
He said there's nothing worse than when he dealt with

01:08:22.890 --> 01:08:25.890
over the decades with Israel and all the rest of it.

01:08:25.890 --> 01:08:28.890
Also, I tell another story about them coming to the embassy

01:08:28.890 --> 01:08:31.890
and meeting with you guys and always giving gifts

01:08:31.890 --> 01:08:34.890
with open bugs in them knowing you're going to find it.

01:08:34.890 --> 01:08:37.890
Like, is it just like they don't want you there?

01:08:37.890 --> 01:08:41.890
I mean, but this is our loving ally, our best little pal.

01:08:41.890 --> 01:08:45.890
Yeah, this is something else that we had to deal with.

01:08:45.890 --> 01:08:50.890
You carry on liaison meetings all the time

01:08:50.890 --> 01:08:52.890
with visiting intelligence services,

01:08:52.890 --> 01:08:55.890
literally every single day.

01:08:55.890 --> 01:08:58.890
And the Israelis, we had to stop allowing

01:08:58.890 --> 01:09:00.890
onto the CIA headquarters campus

01:09:00.890 --> 01:09:02.890
because every time they'd come, they would bring a gift.

01:09:02.890 --> 01:09:04.890
And every time they brought a gift,

01:09:04.890 --> 01:09:06.890
it had a listening device installed inside

01:09:06.890 --> 01:09:08.890
and it was packed with batteries.

01:09:08.890 --> 01:09:11.890
And we would tell them, you guys have to stop doing this.

01:09:11.890 --> 01:09:14.890
Every time you come here, you try to bug our conference rooms.

01:09:14.890 --> 01:09:17.890
So now when we meet with the Israelis, it's off campus.

01:09:17.890 --> 01:09:18.890
You just can't trust them.

01:09:18.890 --> 01:09:20.890
And by the way, if I as a U.S. citizen, let's say,

01:09:20.890 --> 01:09:23.890
asked for a tour and I got caught it lately

01:09:23.890 --> 01:09:25.890
even in the cafeteria, placing a bug.

01:09:25.890 --> 01:09:26.890
I'd probably get 20 years of prison.

01:09:26.890 --> 01:09:27.890
Test me an option.

01:09:27.890 --> 01:09:32.890
Without any question, you would go straight to federal prison.

01:09:32.890 --> 01:09:33.890
Yes.

01:09:33.890 --> 01:09:36.890
So, and if I work for the CIA and I leak something,

01:09:36.890 --> 01:09:37.890
I'd go to jail.

01:09:37.890 --> 01:09:40.890
So the point is, is that how,

01:09:40.890 --> 01:09:43.890
I don't even understand the psychology of that.

01:09:43.890 --> 01:09:46.890
And not just you telling me this has come out.

01:09:46.890 --> 01:09:51.890
Why, what is the motive of behaving like this?

01:09:51.890 --> 01:09:56.890
I've been told that the motive is the desire,

01:09:56.890 --> 01:10:00.890
the unequivocal desire for survival,

01:10:00.890 --> 01:10:04.890
that the Israelis understand, sure, we're friends, we're allies,

01:10:04.890 --> 01:10:09.890
but nobody can save the Israelis, but the Israelis at the end of the day.

01:10:09.890 --> 01:10:12.890
And on the off chance that we're not giving them

01:10:12.890 --> 01:10:16.890
literally everything we have in terms of defense and intelligence,

01:10:16.890 --> 01:10:18.890
then by God, they're going to steal it from us

01:10:18.890 --> 01:10:20.890
and they're going to use it to protect themselves.

01:10:20.890 --> 01:10:22.890
Don't they get being highly aggressive like that?

01:10:22.890 --> 01:10:24.890
Is what's turning everybody against them?

01:10:24.890 --> 01:10:26.890
I don't think they care.

01:10:26.890 --> 01:10:27.890
Well, let me ask you this.

01:10:27.890 --> 01:10:28.890
I think they don't care.

01:10:28.890 --> 01:10:31.890
Did you ever see grading them, were there other agencies,

01:10:31.890 --> 01:10:33.890
because everybody really studies history,

01:10:33.890 --> 01:10:35.890
I'm not an intelligence expert, I've studied, it's very interesting.

01:10:35.890 --> 01:10:37.890
You know, the Russians are all just straight up,

01:10:37.890 --> 01:10:40.890
we love you, we're your friend, you want sex, you want money.

01:10:40.890 --> 01:10:42.890
The Chinese, same deal.

01:10:42.890 --> 01:10:45.890
You know, sex operative, stuff like that.

01:10:45.890 --> 01:10:49.890
But instead the Israelis is just pure muscle,

01:10:49.890 --> 01:10:52.890
pure in your face, pure blackmail, pure attack.

01:10:52.890 --> 01:10:54.890
That historically, I would think would be the,

01:10:54.890 --> 01:10:57.890
I know I've read books about interrogators and how to monitor people.

01:10:57.890 --> 01:11:00.890
Like usually it's the good cop that gets people to do what they want.

01:11:00.890 --> 01:11:01.890
Exactly.

01:11:01.890 --> 01:11:03.890
So why do they behave like this?

01:11:03.890 --> 01:11:04.890
Exactly.

01:11:04.890 --> 01:11:09.890
Alex, with, I never encountered another intelligence service

01:11:09.890 --> 01:11:14.890
that didn't understand from deep down,

01:11:14.890 --> 01:11:17.890
didn't understand that it is the light touch

01:11:17.890 --> 01:11:18.890
that wins a person over.

01:11:18.890 --> 01:11:21.890
It's the good cop who wins the person over.

01:11:21.890 --> 01:11:24.890
You can't just punch people in the face over and over and over

01:11:24.890 --> 01:11:27.890
and over and over and expect them to do your bidding

01:11:27.890 --> 01:11:30.890
or to treat you like an equal and a friend.

01:11:30.890 --> 01:11:33.890
The Russians would never treat people like this,

01:11:33.890 --> 01:11:36.890
the Chinese, the Cubans, the British.

01:11:36.890 --> 01:11:39.890
I mean how do they operate?

01:11:39.890 --> 01:11:41.890
I already said the British were about the best you'd seen,

01:11:41.890 --> 01:11:44.890
but I mean describe the British versus the Russians,

01:11:44.890 --> 01:11:47.890
it's so interesting, or the Chinese.

01:11:47.890 --> 01:11:50.890
You engage a person in conversation

01:11:50.890 --> 01:11:53.890
and that conversation you want to eventually lead to friendship

01:11:53.890 --> 01:11:56.890
and when the conversation leads to friendship,

01:11:56.890 --> 01:12:00.890
the friendship is going to lead to something even closer

01:12:00.890 --> 01:12:03.890
to the point where this person is going to be willing

01:12:03.890 --> 01:12:05.890
to commit espionage for you,

01:12:05.890 --> 01:12:07.890
or in some cases to commit treason for you

01:12:07.890 --> 01:12:11.890
just because you are their best friend.

01:12:11.890 --> 01:12:13.890
When I first got hired at the CIA,

01:12:13.890 --> 01:12:15.890
I asked a question in training

01:12:15.890 --> 01:12:18.890
about the use of honey pots, for example.

01:12:18.890 --> 01:12:22.890
A honey pot is when you try to entrap someone using sex

01:12:22.890 --> 01:12:24.890
and my instructor said, oh no, no,

01:12:24.890 --> 01:12:26.890
we haven't done that since the 50s.

01:12:26.890 --> 01:12:28.890
That just doesn't work.

01:12:28.890 --> 01:12:30.890
It makes people angry.

01:12:30.890 --> 01:12:35.890
It doesn't allow you to create a relationship

01:12:35.890 --> 01:12:37.890
based on trust, right?

01:12:37.890 --> 01:12:40.890
And you want the relationship really to be based on trust.

01:12:40.890 --> 01:12:43.890
Well, the Israelis don't care if you like them

01:12:43.890 --> 01:12:44.890
or trust them.

01:12:44.890 --> 01:12:46.890
They're going to punch you in the face

01:12:46.890 --> 01:12:48.890
and they're going to poop in your toilets

01:12:48.890 --> 01:12:50.890
and they're going to cut your dog's tail off

01:12:50.890 --> 01:12:53.890
and then they're going to run a guy against you

01:12:53.890 --> 01:12:56.890
in Congress because you're not pro-Israeli enough.

01:12:56.890 --> 01:12:58.890
I never understood it.

01:12:58.890 --> 01:13:01.890
And so I go back to the Nick Fuentes thing,

01:13:01.890 --> 01:13:03.890
very popular, very articulate.

01:13:03.890 --> 01:13:06.890
I don't agree with many things he says,

01:13:06.890 --> 01:13:08.890
but I didn't know his origin story

01:13:08.890 --> 01:13:09.890
until the day I did an interview

01:13:09.890 --> 01:13:11.890
and I actually watched part of it

01:13:11.890 --> 01:13:12.890
and it was true.

01:13:12.890 --> 01:13:15.890
He was pro-Israel working at the daily wire

01:13:15.890 --> 01:13:17.890
and they literally tried to get him to go to Israel,

01:13:17.890 --> 01:13:18.890
make him do all this pro-Israel stuff.

01:13:18.890 --> 01:13:19.890
He goes, what's this about Israel?

01:13:19.890 --> 01:13:21.890
So he starts investigating and finds out

